# The repository root ignores `*.md`, because that rule targets service
# documentation that lives with the services. Everything under this directory is
# published: the CLI module, its installer and release config, and the handful of
# markdown files a visitor to the public repository reads first. They are
# re-included explicitly so a change here cannot be silently left out of the
# subtree split.
!/docs/
!/docs/*
!/README.md
!/SECURITY.md
!/CONTRIBUTING.md

# Build output: `make build` and `make release` (a GoReleaser snapshot).
/bin/
/dist/
